  "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/lasantosr/intelli-shell/zipball/v3.4.5",
  "body": "This patch release addresses a keybinding regression affecting PowerShell integration on Windows environments.\r\n\r\n### Bug Fixes\r\n\r\n- **PowerShell Keybinding on Windows:** Restored the default search keybinding for PowerShell on Windows back to `Ctrl+Spacebar`. A recent update inadvertently changed this to `Ctrl+space`, which caused compatibility issues as PSReadLine on Windows specifically expects `Ctrl+Spacebar`. The `Ctrl+D2` workaround for Linux environments remains preserved and unaffected."
}
